Officers of the University

ISRA UNIVERSITY ACT, 1997
ISRA UNIVERSITY ACT, 1997
An Act to provide for the
establishment of the Isra University at Hyderabad
[Gazette of Sindh, Extraordinary,
Part IV, 27th September, 1997]
No. PAS/Legis‑B‑11/97,
dated 27‑9‑1997.‑‑The Isra University Bill, 1997 having
been passed by the Provincial Assembly of Sindh on 24th May, 1997 and assented
to by the Governor of Sindh on 3rd September, 1997 is hereby published as an
Act of the Legislature of Sindh.
CHAPTER III
OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
5. Officers of the University.‑‑The
following shall be the officers of the University:‑‑
(i) the Chancellor;
(ii) the Vice‑Chancellor;
(iii) the Deans;
(iv) the Director;
(v) the Chairmen of the Teaching
Departments;
(vi) the Registrar;
(vii) the Director of Finance;
(viii) the Controller of
Examinations;
(ix) the Resident Auditor;
(x) the Librarian; and
(xi) such other persons as may be
prescribed by the regulations to be the officers
